# MySQL Date Functions – Practice

## 1. Database & Table

```sql
CREATE DATABASE date_functions_practice;
USE date_functions_practice;

CREATE TABLE employees (
    emp_id INT PRIMARY KEY,
    emp_name VARCHAR(50),
    department VARCHAR(30),
    salary INT,
    joining_date DATE,
    birth_date DATE
);
```

