# Date Filtering Practice

## Q13. Find employees who joined in 2022.

```sql
SELECT *
FROM employees
WHERE YEAR(joining_date) = 2022;
```

## Q14. Find employees who joined after 2021.

```sql
SELECT *
FROM employees
WHERE joining_date > '2021-12-31';
```

## Q15. Find employees who joined in January.

```sql
SELECT *
FROM employees
WHERE MONTH(joining_date) = 1;
```

## Q16. Find employees who joined after January 1, 2022.

```sql
SELECT *
FROM employees
WHERE joining_date > '2022-01-01';
```

## Q17. Find employees who joined between 2020 and 2023.

```sql
SELECT *
FROM employees
WHERE joining_date BETWEEN '2020-01-01' AND '2023-12-31';
```

