# Functions Practiced

| Function | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `CURDATE()` | Current date |
| `NOW()` | Current date + time |
| `YEAR()` | Extract year |
| `MONTH()` | Extract month number |
| `DAY()` | Extract day |
| `DAYNAME()` | Get weekday name |
| `MONTHNAME()` | Get month name |
| `DATEDIFF()` | Difference between dates |
| `DATE_ADD()` | Add time to a date |
| `DATE_SUB()` | Subtract time from a date |
| `DATE_FORMAT()` | Format a date |
| `TIMESTAMPDIFF()` | Calculate difference in years/months/days |

